      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKY KEEPING (3) was in trouble and took a tumble last time but prior to that was a NG winner in the quickest time on the card at this track. No luck latest and worth another chance. CREEPING MYLO (8) has a strong record here with five wins and six placings from 13 starts. Below best last time at Richmond (23.86) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 17 length sixth. Can hit the frame with the right run. HYBRID BLUE (1) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (20.94) last time in a Grade 5 at Gunnedah. Solid record here winning four races. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Can measure up this time. KITE (2) is new to this circuit but not to be underestimated.",
